{"name": "old-shit/lift-tests", "created": 1789531266.218729, "updated": 1789531313.007431, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.5, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "turn": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "root": "a1f8c1b2", "current": "a1f8c1b2", "nodes": {"a1f8c1b2": {"id": "a1f8c1b2", "parent": null, "kind": "root", "text": "Municipal Lifts Office\nAcceptance tests following the removal of a floor\n\nBuilding 6, North Court. The fourth floor was removed on 11 March. Its button has been blanked. No alteration to the numbering of the floors above is authorised.\n\nTest 1. Empty car sent from third to fifth. Passed without stopping.\nTest 2. Car loaded with sacks to the weight of one adult. Passed without stopping.\nTest 3. Same load, with a hat placed on the upper sack. Stopped between third and fifth. Doors remained closed for the regulation interval.\n\nThe inspector repeated Test 3 without the hat. This time\n", "ts": 1789531266.218729, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": null}, "7493b72c": {"id": "7493b72c", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift continued as if nothing had happened. It seems that a hat has an effect comparable to an additional passenger.\nIf it should ever happen that two hats are found together in a lift, there should", "ts": 1789531272.131052, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 9.5, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "384c3c86": {"id": "384c3c86", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the doors opened. He declared the lift in accordance with regulations, subject to the further investigation of the matter of the hat.\n\nI should have said that the hat had no visible means of propulsion; but", "ts": 1789531275.723437, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.3, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "bb690fca": {"id": "bb690fca", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift passed without stopping.\nHe concluded that the failure had been due to the presence\nof the hat.\nA hat was accordingly removed from the wall in the hall,\nand placed in a drawer.\n", "ts": 1789531279.30957, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.3, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "3bc0f88a": {"id": "3bc0f88a", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the car stopped, as required by regulation, then proceeded.\n\nTest 4. Empty car, loaded to 70% with sacks to a weight equal to two adults, then 85%.", "ts": 1789531282.955922, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.1, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "bbc0c923": {"id": "bbc0c923", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the car passed successfully to fifth, and back to first without incident.\nTests 4 to 11 inclusive: Passed. No hat.\n\nSigned:\n\nLifts Supervisor\n\nLifts Assistant\n\n", "ts": 1789531286.5879319, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.1, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "623dfc19": {"id": "623dfc19", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift reached its destination without incident.", "ts": 1789531287.422076, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 9, "tps": 11.3, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "c4de7456": {"id": "c4de7456", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "Test 3b. the doors opened on reaching the fifth. No alteration to the system is required.\n\nTest 4. With two men inside (the inspector and myself), we sent the lift empty", "ts": 1789531290.999167, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.3, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "8c7587f8": {"id": "8c7587f8", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the car arrived at its destination safely.", "ts": 1789531291.854914, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 9, "tps": 10.9, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "34dd020d": {"id": "34dd020d", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "Test 3a passed.\n\nThe inspector noted that there were signs of recent disturbance around the uppermost floor button.\n\nThe lift will now be brought into use by the municipal administration as Floor 3A", "ts": 1789531295.515284, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.0, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "65e01c10": {"id": "65e01c10", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift stopped and remained between first and second,\nthe doors remaining open, but did not complete the journey to the third.\n\nThis last failure has not yet been rectified; it has caused no\n", "ts": 1789531299.094532, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.3, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "b4cd1708": {"id": "b4cd1708", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "Test 3A: Car passed from third to fifth, though slightly faster than before.\nThe inspector reported the failure in Test 3, but no failure in 3A.", "ts": 1789531302.350591, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 37, "tps": 11.5, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "b145b659": {"id": "b145b659", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift stopped at the fifth floor and opened its doors in compliance with regulations.\nSigned, etc.\nFloors now available for allocation: Fourth\n\nThe lift attendant reported this decision to his office,", "ts": 1789531306.040305, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 10.9, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "b9ff56d2": {"id": "b9ff56d2", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the lift stopped as normal at fifth floor.\nTest 4. With one passenger standing inside the empty lift car. Passed.\nTest 5. Car fully laden with one passenger and seven sacks", "ts": 1789531309.52973, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.6, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "57590f8f": {"id": "57590f8f", "parent": "a1f8c1b2", "kind": "model", "text": "the doors remained closed only for 0.95 of the interval.\nHe reported: 'I find no reason not to authorise use\nof this lift as far as the fifth floor.'", "ts": 1789531313.007348, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 40, "tps": 11.6, "params": {"n_predict": 40, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}}, "title": "Acceptance tests following the removal of a floor"}